  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Divine Power Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Kratos_Blades.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130107000521\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Kratos Blades\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Kratos_Blades.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20130107000521\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Kratos_Blades.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20130107000521 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Kratos_Blades.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130107000521 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Kratos Blades\" width=\"270\" height=\"284\" data-image-key=\"Kratos_Blades.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Kratos Blades.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Kratos (God of War) could steal the powers of Greek gods that he killed in battle.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb/steal divine power</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb/steal the powers of deities</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Deity_Manipulation\" title=\"Deity Manipulation\">Deity Manipulation</a>.  Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Demonic Power Absorption\">Demonic Power Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Almighty Replication\">Almighty Replication</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Power_Replication\" title=\"Divine Power Replication\">Divine Power Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Divine Ability Absorption</li>\n<li>Divinity Theft</li>\n<li>Transcendent Power/Ability Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb and/or steal the powers of deities, rendering them powerless and mortal, while the user becomes a god themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deity_Consumption\" title=\"Deity Consumption\">Deity Consumption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Slayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Divine Slayer\">Divine Slayer</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Imbued_Godhood\" title=\"Imbued Godhood\">Imbued</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Artificial_Godhood\" title=\"Artificial Godhood\">Artificial Godhood</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Physiology\">Transcendent Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Negation\" title=\"Transcendent Negation\">Transcendent</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Divinity_Nullification\" title=\"Divinity Nullification\">Divinity Nullification</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Mortalization\" title=\"Mortalization\">Mortalization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Immortality_Negation\" title=\"Immortality Negation\">Immortality Negation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Thievery/Absolute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Thievery/Absolute\">Absolute Thievery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Ascension\" title=\"Almighty Ascension\">Almighty Ascension</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Divine Energy Absorption\">Divine Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnislayer\" title=\"Omnislayer\">Omnislayer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Titan_Physiology\" title=\"Titan Physiology\">Titan Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Physiology\">Transcendent Physiology</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May overload with the stolen powers.\n<ul><li>The user's body may become unstable as a result.</li>\n<li>If killed the powers return to their original owners.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Sage (<i>Angel Tales</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Yhwach\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Yhwach\">Yhwach</a> (<i>Bleach</i>); via absorbing the Soul King</li>\n<li>Campione (<i>Campione!</i>)\n<ul><li>Godou Kusanagi</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://classofthetitans.fandom.com/wiki/Theresa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:classofthetitans:Theresa\">Theresa</a> (<i>Class of the Titans</i>)</li>\n<li>Antares (<i>DanMachi</i>)</li>\n<li>Oz (<i>Divine Gate</i>)</li>\n<li>The Father (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Kefka (<i>Final Fantasy VI</i>)</li>\n<li>Father (<i>Fullmetal Alchemist</i>); via absorbing \"God\"</li>\n<li>Kratos (<i>God of War</i>); Greek gods only</li>\n<li>Kwon Ohjin (<i>I'm not a Regressor</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Almighty_Creature\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Almighty Creature\">Almighty Creatures</a> (<i>Karsearin: Adventures of a Red Dragon</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Eldicreature\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Eldicreature\">Eldicreature</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mugen-souls.fandom.com/wiki/Syrma\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:mugen-souls:Syrma\">Syrma</a>&#160;(<i>Mugen Souls Z</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://solo-leveling.fandom.com/wiki/Sung_Jinwoo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:solo-leveling:Sung Jinwoo\">Sung Jinwoo</a> (<i>Solo Leveling</i>)</li>\n<li>Jack Kline (<i>Supernatural</i>)</li>\n<li>Kronos (<i>Wrath of the Titans</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDivine_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Blade of Olympus (<i>God of War</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://riordan.fandom.com/wiki/The_Red_Pyramid\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:riordan:The Red Pyramid\">The Red Pyramid</a> (<i>The Red Pyramid</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redi